{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51138","headline":"留题云门（一作「秦望山」） · 萧翼","name":"留题云门（一作「秦望山」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝顶高峯（一作「山」）路不分。\n岚烟（一作「烟岚」）长锁绿苔纹。\n弥猴推落临（一作「悬」）崖石。\n打破（一作「落」）下方遮日云。\n（《万首唐人绝句》十一、《古今图书集成·山川典》一○五《秦望山部》）（北宋孔延之编《会稽掇献总集》卷六已收此诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}